packing for hunza/skardu (december!!)
- thermal inners x2, woollen socks x4, down jacket, gloves, beanie
- power bank x2 (cold kills batteries), charging cables
- sunglasses + sunscreen (snow glare)
- lip balm, moisturiser
- basic meds: panadol, ORS, motion sickness tablets
- CNIC + copies (checkposts)
- cash: ATMs unreliable after Gilgit
- flask for chai
- camera, extra SD card
